VendorApp CustomTextFieldWidget (isNumber) uses FilteringTextInputFormatter.allow(RegExp(r'[0-9]')) (lib/common/widgets/custom_text_field_widget.dart:120).
Arabic-Indic digits U+0660-0669 from an Arabic digit keypad are filtered out silently -> a user whose IME emits them cannot enter a value in the (required-on-food) Preparation time field. Pre-existing shared widget (also affects maximum order quantity etc).
Device observation: with system locale English, keypad emits Latin digits and entry works (60 saved). Arabic-Indic IME path NOT reproduced on device (adb input text cannot inject non-ASCII) - code evidence only.
